mapping "V9393.1" source="V9393" target="215414001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V93.9.3 (Swedish extension) = accident on board unspecified watercraft, other activity.
        Parent V93.9 (Accident on board watercraft without accident to watercraft, unspecified
        watercraft) has Athena SNOMED 215414001 edge to SNOMED CT 438301. The Swedish.9X sub-codes only add
        an activity axis (sport, leisure, work, vital activity, etc.); SNOMED CT has no concept for that
        axis, so the target subsumes the source's clinical meaning while dropping the activity detail.
        Broader, one level; Athena crosswalk on parent.
        """
}
mapping "V9394.1" source="V9394" target="215414001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V93.9.4 = accident on board unspecified watercraft, vital activity
        (rest/sleep/meals/personal hygiene). Same logic as V9393: parent V93.9 maps to SNOMED CT 438301 via
        Athena; activity suffix is administrative detail with no SNOMED CT representation. Broader.
        """
}
